#N canvas 20 20 1100 620 12;
#X text 20 20 e_rec -- a recorder that can stop \, in e_tape and e_rush: its signal into a delay line \, always \, but while a player reads it: switch~ off leaves the line and its write head where they are. It comes back in over three blocks and goes out over three \, so where two stretches of recording meet there is silence \, not a click., f 60;
#X text 20 170 creation args: 1 the \$0 of the abstraction reading it \, whose \$1-line it writes. 2 the line's length in ms. inlet~: what to record. inlet: on <1 or 0> and gain <level> <ms>., f 60;
#X obj 20 280 inlet~;
#X obj 300 280 inlet;
#X obj 300 320 route on gain;
#X obj 300 380 line~;
#X obj 20 420 *~;
#X obj 20 480 delwrite~ \$1-line \$2;
#X obj 500 380 switch~;
#X obj 700 280 loadbang;
#X obj 700 320 t b b;
#X msg 800 380 1;
#X msg 700 380 1;
